    "body": "I recommend posting this as a feature request at https://github.com/w3c/webappsec-referrer-policy/issues/new as any change here needs buy-in from that community. The `referrerpolicy` attribute and various features in Fetch can also be used to override the policy to something less restrictive so this would basically be a new mechanism. Hope that helps.",
